                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">筑梦一中<SPAN lang=EN-US>|</SPAN>我校<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年美术特长生招生开始啦！<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">一、招生计划</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">招生人数：<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>人</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">招生项目：美术特长生</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">二、报名条件</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">初三应届毕业生，思想品德优秀，行为端正、身心健康、学习习惯好、有团队精神，有志于报考美术专业，同时须具备以下条件之一：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">获得省国画、西画类艺术特长水平测试<SPAN lang=EN-US>B</SPAN>级证书及以上的学生。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">初中阶段获现场美术比赛个人区一等奖或市级比赛二等奖（含）及以上者（教育行政部门组织）。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">特别有潜力者，需要初中学校出具证明。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">三、报名程序<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">报名组织。符合报名条件的考生填写《绍兴市第一中学美术特长生招生报名表》（见学校官网），并将纸质报名表、相关荣誉证书复印件（加盖初中学校公章）、身份证或户口本复印件，于<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>22</SPAN>日前交至绍兴市第一中学教学处（地址：绍兴市越城区站前大道<SPAN lang=EN-US>1989</SPAN>号，树兰楼<SPAN lang=EN-US>2014</SPAN>室，联系人：周文龙老师；联系电话：<SPAN lang=EN-US>18906858234</SPAN>），材料不齐者不予受理。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">资格审查。报名后，学校负责审核考生资格，向市教育局报备后，将结果于<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>23</SPAN>日前在绍兴市第一中学官网上公布。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">四、测试</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">时间：<SPAN lang=EN-US> 2019</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>25</SPAN>日上午<SPAN lang=EN-US>8:30--11:00</SPAN>素描测试，下午<SPAN lang=EN-US>13:30--16:00</SPAN>色彩测试<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">地点：绍兴市第一中学树兰楼四楼美术教室</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">测试内容分两部分：素描测试（<SPAN lang=EN-US>50%</SPAN>），色彩测试（<SPAN lang=EN-US>50%</SPAN>）。两部分测试成绩按比例相加为综合测试成绩。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">五、录取办法<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">（一）入围“美术特长生”的考生必须参加当年初中学业水平考试，且学业水平考试成绩总分<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>不低于<SPAN lang=EN-US>680</SPAN>分。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">（二）录取操作规则</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">专业成绩择优。在入围的考生中，按专业成绩从高分到低分依次录取。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">在专业测试成绩相同时，按初中学业水平考试成绩总分<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>从高分到低分录取。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">当报考人数小于或等于招生人数时，由考评小组严格评审，宁缺勿滥。 </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">（三）签订协议</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">在正式录取时，学校与考生签订训练、比赛协议，明确其在高中学习期间有参加常规训练和集训的义务，并代表学校参加相关比赛的职责。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
