<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">一、测试项目：</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">素描、色彩<SPAN lang=EN-US>(</SPAN>材料限水粉或丙烯<SPAN lang=EN-US>)</SPAN>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">二、测试时间与地点：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">时间：<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>25</SPAN>日上午<SPAN lang=EN-US>8:30-11:00</SPAN>测试素描；下午<SPAN lang=EN-US>13:30-16:00</SPAN>测试色彩。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">地点：绍兴一中树兰楼四楼<SPAN lang=EN-US>4024</SPAN>（美术教室二）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
