<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">四、各项分值及要求：</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">　</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋"><FONT face=Calibri>　<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>．素描：素描静物的写生或默写，在<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>开铅画纸上完成一幅作品。满分<SPAN lang=EN-US>100</SPAN>分；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋"><FONT face=Calibri>　　要求：构图完整，形体结构准确，明暗、空间关系处理得当，有一定的塑造表现能力。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
