<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">　　要求：构图合理，能较好地表现色调及色彩关系，有一定的塑造能力和表现力。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">五、评分办法：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">　　<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>．考务人员对考生作品进行编号、匿名；评委不进入试场，不与考生见面；</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">　　<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>．考生术科成绩由分项成绩素描分的<SPAN lang=EN-US>50%</SPAN>、色彩分的<SPAN lang=EN-US>50%</SPAN>相加而成，满分<SPAN lang=EN-US>100</SPAN>分。</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt">六、注意事项：</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 0.05pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>1. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">考生考试当天早上在绍兴一中西门（站前大道<SPAN lang=EN-US>1898</SPAN>号），凭身份证或户口簿进校，接送的家长一律在校门外等候，私家车在校门外有序停放。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 0.05pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">考生于<SPAN lang=EN-US>8:00</SPAN>在树兰楼四楼<SPAN lang=EN-US>4024</SPAN>（美术教室二）门口集中，凭身份证或户口本抽签有序进入考场，在与签号相对应的座位号位置进<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: -0.05pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 0.05pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">行作画，<SPAN lang=EN-US>8:15</SPAN>以后停止进场；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
